  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - Kukula Solar- Eradicating Energy Poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kukula Solar sell durable, solar lanterns quality products to families living in slum and rural communities. This face-to-face distribution network allows us to build relationships and trust with our customers. It also means we gain regular feedback about the performance of our products and the needs of the families we serve, so we can keep providing the right products at the right price. Kukula Solar also works with families directly in their homes providing education on our products and how to use them. This empowers families to create cleaner, safer and healthier homes. We offer all customers a short term payment plan to make our solar products affordable and accessible to all regardless of their income. The rate of defaults on this Rent-to-Own model is less than 1%. Our products have a minimum one year warranty and we provide post-sale servicing. This model allows families to save 15 percent of their income, and improve their health, safety and quality of life.</narrative>
  </description>
